"type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-14T23:43:43Z","updated_at":"2024-11-14T23:43:43Z","body":"> I can't get it to suggest at all. Tested in v4.4.dev.custom_build [[277cb68](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/277cb68e1a743efb14a8b8be1e63e9fba14bc6dc)].\r\n\r\nI also had this issue in v4.4.dev.custom_build [673f39667]. \r\n\r\nAfter I switched back to v4.3.1.rc.custom_build [33c02a5c6] I could reproduce the original issue","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2477634759/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2477803339","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99211#issuecomment-2477803339","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99211","id":2477803339,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TsEdL","user":{"login":"btgs-0","id":149745752,"node_id":"U_kgDOCOzwWA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149745752?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/btgs-0","html_url":"https://github.com/btgs-0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btgs-0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btgs-0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btgs-0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btgs-0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btgs-0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btgs-0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btgs-0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btgs-0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btgs-0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-15T02:03:57Z","updated_at":"2024-11-15T02:03:57Z","body":"I had a look at this one for a bit. It looks the _guess_expression_type at line 3092 is not setting a value on the completion identifier **ci**:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd9cf0ab-e4e9-4257-aef8-6b3bea778838)\r\nThis is then being passed into the _find_call_arguments defined on line 2716:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e9d5922d-ad47-4149-ad48-cb90ee5fc643)\r\nFinally, because the type is 'NIL' it fails this check on line 2783: \r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e51fb1b7-3ced-4f0e-b25e-d05de8b004a5)\r\nwhich means it does not run the obj get_argument_options method which produces the options hint and dropdown values. This happens for animation_player1 and animation_player2 but not animation_player3\r\n\r\nIt looks like the above problem is fixed in master, but master has a different issue that is causing the same outcome. The get_argument_options method has been removed from AnimationPlayer in master\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8213df6a-c0fc-4cb7-8caa-cc651204bd2d)\r\nAs such, the method being called is AnimationMixer::get_argument_options:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d1edbd9f-c566-45e3-bda2-8db38e834e40)\r\nThis method does not handle the \"play\" argument and therefore doesn't run get_animation_list and return the animation options","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2477803339/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]